hokku-server (4.0.1~dev.21-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix(server): pin the numeric stack's threads (OPENBLAS/OMP/MKL=1, numba=2).
    Un-pinned, numpy/scipy/OpenBLAS grabbed 4 threads/core and blew past the
    Pi's RLIMIT_NPROC + thrashed RAM — a cold-cache re-JIT boot never settled.

